<article class="card prod pc" data-c="alimentos" data-id="ceibo"><div class="aw"><svg class="art" viewBox="0 0 300 180" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="300" height="180" fill="#F3E6BD"/><path d="M0 130 C70 100 140 125 300 105 V180 H0Z" fill="#9DBF70"/><rect x="190" y="70" width="48" height="66" rx="10" fill="#D9962B"/><rect x="196" y="58" width="36" height="14" rx="4" fill="#7A4A12"/><rect x="198" y="92" width="32" height="22" rx="4" fill="#F6E7B8"/><g fill="#4F8A32"><ellipse cx="80" cy="120" rx="16" ry="30" transform="rotate(-25 80 120)"/><ellipse cx="108" cy="116" rx="16" ry="30" transform="rotate(10 108 116)"/><ellipse cx="136" cy="124" rx="14" ry="26" transform="rotate(35 136 124)"/></g></svg><span class="badge">Cosecha fresca</span><button class="heart" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Guardar Finca Agroecológica El Ceibo">♥</button></div><div class="bd"><span class="rt"><i>★</i> 4,9</span><span class="tag">Miel y verduras</span><h3>Finca Agroecológica El Ceibo</h3><div class="m">Colonia</div><p>Miel pura, verduras de estación y visita a la huerta.</p><div class="pr">Miel orgánica de pradera (1 kg): $350</div><button class="speak" type="button" aria-pressed="false">🔊 Escuchar</button></div></article>
